  Definition:
    Id: superego_death
    DisplayName: Superego Death
    ShortName: SUPE
    Description: The first enemy it hits becomes two copies of itself at half health
      each, silenced and disarmed for a moment. Nothing splits twice. Shooting a
      split enemy charges extra psi.
